{"pageId":"eb531546-d13a-47a7-ab95-5c221617243d","pageCanonId":"276f1bd7-d048-49fd-8483-f267f2ece13d","title":"所有按钮（All buttons）","slug":"all-buttons","headerTitle":"所有按钮","description":"为某个操作选择合适的按钮时，请考虑每种按钮类型所提供的强调程度","headerAlignment":"LEFT","isDescriptionVisible":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-07-17T06:58:41.575Z","headerImageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fm3%2Fimages%2Fmrokrjo9-All%20buttons.png?alt=media&token=cbf70d23-43a2-4d6b-be55-f1ccf6c8ef40","sections":[{"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","name":"Tab 1","position":0,"pageId":"b3948a82-f325-4c2e-b3a3-3ec657dd45ff","pageCanonId":"276f1bd7-d048-49fd-8483-f267f2ece13d","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"ff2df955-2b76-4563-a011-7ed827f329f3","pageContentBlockCanonId":"808732e9-b710-4982-b91b-31f825bac1c4","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"ebbac7bd-6e2d-4bb8-99cd-a231599f7cec","pageContentChunkCanonId":"7093a93b-f6dd-47f7-96e7-f757512c5953","htmlValue":"<h5><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\" id=\"isPasted\">Material 3 中有 10 种按钮类型。 </span></h5>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.228Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"b30dad83-64a0-4181-b90d-6daf43027884","pageContentBlockCanonId":"9134ac95-678e-49ae-a50a-e71948011b05","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"7d297a0b-5b9e-483b-b7b2-4135eb5be9bb","pageContentChunkCanonId":"d7e528a8-ead2-4110-950f-48da9db95537","htmlValue":null,"footer":"<ol><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">按钮<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">开关按钮<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">图标按钮<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">开关图标按钮<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">拆分按钮<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">标准按钮组<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">连接按钮组<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">浮动操作按钮（FAB） <br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">扩展 FAB<br /></span></li><li><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">FAB 菜单</span></li></ol>","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fm4kdl8gi-1.png?alt=media&token=78222465-efb0-405d-9e25-3a771b475e3a","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":1720,"imageWidth":2048,"altText":"10 种按钮类型。","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":null,"showBorderAroundMedia":null,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.232Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"3e52b43b-ee18-446c-b521-232c1000df52","pageContentBlockCanonId":"8c99bd60-70b4-445e-b8d2-5442dd0fdc8e","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"6942cdd7-da58-4e66-898a-a466103a7076","pageContentChunkCanonId":"38243669-7dbb-4549-a7a5-e63ba73f55d9","htmlValue":"<h2>选择按钮</h2><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table class=\"borderGGrey400\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:22.4465%;text-align:left\"><p>强调程度</p></th><th style=\"width:13.6474%;text-align:left\"><p>组件</p></th><th style=\"width:51.0869%;text-align:left\"><p>理由</p></th><th style=\"width:12.6322%;text-align:left\"><p>操作示例</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th rowspan=\"4\" style=\"width:22.4638%;vertical-align:top\"><p>高强调：用于屏幕上最主要、最重要或最常见的操作</p></th><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/extended-fab/overview/\" target=\"_blank\">扩展 FAB</a>、<a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/fab/overview/\" target=\"_blank\">FAB</a> 和 <a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/fab-menu/overview\" target=\"_blank\">FAB 菜单</a><br /></p></td><td><p>FAB 和扩展 FAB 是尺寸最大、视觉上最突出的按钮。它们专为页面的主要操作而设计。扩展 FAB 最适合大屏幕。FAB 菜单提供多个选项。<br /></p></td><td><p>创建 <br />撰写<br />新会话<br />新建文件<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/common-buttons/guidelines#9ecffdb3-ef29-47e7-8d5d-f78b404fcafe\" target=\"_blank\">填充按钮</a><br /></p></td><td><p>填充按钮采用 primary 调色板，使其成为仅次于 FAB 的最突出按钮。它用于流程中的最终操作或解除阻塞的操作。<br /></p></td><td><p>保存<br />确认<br />完成<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/split-button/overview\" target=\"_blank\">拆分按钮</a><br /></p></td><td><p>拆分按钮的 primary 调色板和菜单图标最适合用于带有多个选项的关键操作。<br /></p></td><td><p>发送<br />添加<br />创建<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/button-groups/overview\" target=\"_blank\">按钮组</a><br /></p></td><td><p>标准按钮组运用颜色、动效和形状来吸引注意力。用它来展示多个关键操作。<br /></p></td><td><p>返回、暂停、下一步<br /><br /></p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p>中强调：用于重要但不会让用户从主要任务中分心的操作</p></th><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/common-buttons/guidelines#07a1577b-aaf5-4824-a698-03526421058b\" target=\"_blank\">色调按钮</a></p></td><td><p>色调按钮采用 secondary 调色板，视觉上不如常规的填充按钮突出。它可用于最终操作或解除阻塞的操作，也可用于辅助操作。<br /></p></td><td><p>保存<br />确认<br />完成<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/common-buttons/guidelines#4e89da4d-a8fa-4e20-bb8d-b8a93eff3e3e\" target=\"_blank\">凸起按钮</a></p></td><td><p>凸起按钮采用 secondary 调色板并带有阴影。仅当按钮需要与带图案的背景形成视觉区隔时才使用。<br /></p></td><td><p>回复<br />查看全部<br />加入购物车<br />从垃圾箱移出<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/common-buttons/guidelines#3742b09f-c224-43e0-a83e-541bd29d0f05\" target=\"_blank\">描边按钮</a><br /></p></td><td><p>描边按钮用于需要关注但并非主要操作的场景，例如“查看全部”或“加入购物车”。它也适合用于让用户有机会改变主意或退出某个流程。</p></td><td><p>回复<br />查看全部<br />加入购物车<br />从垃圾箱移出<br /></p></td></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align:top\"><p>低强调：用于最不突出、可选或补充性的操作</p></th><td></td><td><p>连接按钮组显示多个相关选项。用于切换页面上可见的内容。<br /></p></td><td><p>步行、骑行、驾车<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/common-buttons/guidelines#c9bcbc0b-ee05-45ad-8e80-e814ae919fbb\" target=\"_blank\">文本按钮</a></p></td><td><p>文本按钮没有描边或填充。它应用于对用户旅程并非必不可少的操作。<br /></p></td><td><p>了解详情<br />查看全部<br />切换账号<br />开启<br /></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><a href=\"/m3-material-zh/m3/pages/icon-buttons/overview\" target=\"_blank\">图标按钮</a></p></td><td><p>图标按钮是最紧凑、最含蓄的按钮类型，用于可选的补充操作，例如“收藏”或“加星标”。<br /></p></td><td><p>添加到收藏夹 打印<br /></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.242Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"c8ad13d9-8aba-4e55-8b07-b2bf1291f57d","pageContentBlockCanonId":"a9ca71a6-bc37-46ea-a768-f9e0c6ecdef2","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e7d81de6-6cf1-4b6c-9959-358b2993c5f3","pageContentChunkCanonId":"75b4a794-024e-4fd2-bd89-3415e3d6ca47","htmlValue":"<h2>层级</h2>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.252Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"0b6927f4-9307-4914-a5ca-d873afba08e9","pageContentBlockCanonId":"034147ba-2174-4c0c-bc82-936bcf1394a1","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"1f66dcf9-2e6a-499e-a3dd-b5aaae441f29","pageContentChunkCanonId":"92b799b4-7462-4697-9925-40ceddb34087","htmlValue":"<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>一个高强调按钮</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\" id=\"isPasted\">每个屏幕应只包含一个用于主要操作的醒目按钮。这个高强调按钮会吸引最多的注意力。屏幕元素的排列应清楚地表明其他按钮较不重要。</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br /></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>其他按钮</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\" id=\"isPasted\">产品可以在一个布局中同时显示多个按钮。使用不同的颜色样式来创建视觉层级，并表明每个按钮的重要性。</span></p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":null,"videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.263Z"},{"pageContentChunkId":"db223a95-3c7f-48dd-b662-21f9d147bff3","pageContentChunkCanonId":"969ef389-6988-4a6f-a456-a1acda7a1ed3","htmlValue":null,"footer":"<p>按钮的强调程度有助于决定其外观、字体排印和位置</p>","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fm0gpi7ar-2.png?alt=media&token=e31c5827-b4dd-4fdd-83de-d109e43641c7","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":600,"imageWidth":1352,"altText":"3 种层级：高强调、中强调和低强调。","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":null,"showBorderAroundMedia":null,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":2,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.263Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"d75943c7-219b-4784-99ef-f62ae575b1aa","pageContentBlockCanonId":"bf5e7b0b-65a4-457f-baef-b48bd7ba775d","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"98056eb5-91ad-42df-8b38-e5b6065a2e4b","pageContentChunkCanonId":"2dc06adc-187f-482d-8a3e-7cd131631713","htmlValue":"<h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"isPasted\">摆放位置</h2>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-06-24T07:39:53.272Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"2a3227a6-f69b-4fdb-bb99-18376938b6c5","pageContentBlockCanonId":"a2942905-4661-4003-9efd-21bc680e10c0","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"03646197-2dad-437f-ba25-c77b9001325d","pageSectionCanonId":"0b0817e5-fa3e-4328-91c1-bba689118103","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"f8c918e3-5422-4b52-89d7-24c46a89ad66","pageContentChunkCanonId":"5cb43713-f032-45da-ac0e-d6825850e963","htmlValue":"<p dir=\"ltr\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">在同一屏幕上组合使用按钮样式，将注意力集中在主要操作上，同时提供其他选择。</span></p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":null,"imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"202